  </p>
  <p>
    We do not sell Your Content, and we do not use it to train AI models. You are responsible for Your Content
    and for having the rights needed to store and share it. How we handle personal data is described in our
    <a href="/privacy"> Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai" data-toc-label="8. AI features"><span class="legal-prose__num">08</span>AI features</h2>
  <p>
    The Service includes AI assistants. When you use them, the content you send to an assistant may be
    processed by the model provider you choose, by a self-hosted model, or by Uniffy AI Cloud, in order to
    generate a response. Every action an assistant takes on your behalf runs under your permissions, so an
    assistant cannot access content that you cannot access.
  </p>
  <p>
    AI output can be wrong, incomplete, or misleading. You are responsible for reviewing AI output before you
    rely on it, and you should not treat it as professional advice.
  </p>

  <h2 id="fees" data-toc-label="9. Fees"><span class="legal-prose__num">09</span>Fees and paid plans</h2>
  <p>
    The beta is currently offered free of charge. We may introduce paid plans in the future. If you choose a
    paid plan, we will show the price and billing terms before you buy, and any purchase you make through the
    Apple App Store or Google Play is also subject to that store's payment terms. Taxes may apply.
  </p>

  <h2 id="our-ip" data-toc-label="10. Our IP"><span class="legal-prose__num">10</span>Our intellectual property</h2>
