    <li>if the app fails to conform to any applicable warranty, you may notify Apple, and Apple may refund the purchase price of the app to you, if any. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Apple has no other warranty obligation for the app;</li>
    <li>{COMPANY}, not Apple, is responsible for addressing any claims relating to the app, including product liability, legal or regulatory claims, and claims that the app fails to meet a legal or consumer requirement;</li>
