    warranties of any kind, whether express, implied, or statutory, including warranties of merchantability,
    fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Service will be
    uninterrupted, error free, or secure, which is especially true during the beta. Nothing in these Terms
    limits any rights you have that cannot be limited under the law that applies to you, including mandatory
    consumer rights.
  </p>

  <h2 id="liability" data-toc-label="14. Liability"><span class="legal-prose__num">14</span>Limitation of liability</h2>
