    you paid us for the Service in the three months before the event giving rise to the claim, or fifty euros
    (EUR 50). Some laws do not allow certain limitations, so some of these may not apply to you.
  </p>

  <h2 id="indemnity" data-toc-label="15. Indemnification"><span class="legal-prose__num">15</span>Indemnification</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, you agree to defend and indemnify {COMPANY} against third-party claims,
    damages, and reasonable costs that arise from your misuse of the Service, your violation of these Terms, or
